---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Digital Nomad Tax & Visa Guides (2026)"
pageDescription: "Expert guides on digital nomad visas, cost of living comparisons, and tax optimization strategies for remote workers."
permalink: /blog/
---
<div class="section-container mt-32">
  <div class="text-center mb-16">
    <div class="badge-2026 mx-auto mb-4">RESOURCES & GUIDES</div>
    <h1 class="aura-title" style="font-size: 3.5rem;">The Nomad Knowledge Base</h1>
    <p class="text-dim text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto">Master digital nomad taxes, visas, and global cost of living with our expert guides and research.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="blog-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(350px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem;">
    {% for post in collections.blog | reverse %}
      <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="glass-panel p-8" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-5px)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 15px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='none'; this.style.boxShadow='none'">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-white" style="font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; line-height: 1.3;">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p class="text-dim mb-6" style="line-height: 1.6; flex-grow: 1;">{{ post.data.pageDescription }}</p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm mt-auto border-t border-gray-800 pt-4" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
          <span class="text-primary font-bold" style="color: var(--aura-primary);">Read Guide &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
